    },
    {
      "id": "card-b2-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 204,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 22,
      "text": "[mira] Android Fastboot v0.5 (USB 0x18d1:0x4ee0)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "strokeColor": "#0c4a6e",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "card-b2-desc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 232,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 36,
      "text": "UART 輸出 [mira] fastboot ready，USB 枚舉為 Google Fastboot\n執行 oem partition dump nflasha1 搭配 upload 傾印復原分區",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow-b2-b3",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 36,
      "points": [[0, 0], [0, 36]],
      "strokeColor": "#7c3aed",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1.0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "card-b3",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 318,
      "width": 610,
      "height": 106,
      "strokeColor": "#7c3aed",
      "backgroundColor": "#f5f3ff",
      "strokeWidth": 1.8,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1.1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 2 }
    },
    {
      "id": "card-b3-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 22,
      "text": "原地修補 nflasha1 (/boot/initrd.img SquashFS 4.0)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "strokeColor": "#4c1d95",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "card-b3-desc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 358,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 54,
      "text": "1. 將 /etc/VerificationKey.pem 替換為自訂 RSA-2048 public.pem\n2. 修補 4 個 updater .so 的 verifyKey() 為 00 00 80 52 c0 03 5f d6\n3. 更新 /p1chksum 並將變動的 233 個磁區編碼為 Sparse Image 刷回",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow-b3-b4",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 424,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 36,
      "points": [[0, 0], [0, 36]],
      "strokeColor": "#059669",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1.0,
      "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "card-b4",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 462,
      "width": 610,
      "height": 88,
      "strokeColor": "#059669",
      "backgroundColor": "#ecfdf5",
      "strokeWidth": 1.8,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1.1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 2 }
    },
    {
      "id": "card-b4-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 474,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 22,
      "text": "SD 卡正常刷入自簽章 BODYDATA.DAT",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "strokeColor": "#064e3b",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "card-b4-desc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 65,
      "y": 502,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 36,
      "text": "完整保留 VerifySignature() 的 RSA-2048 (SHA-256) 密碼學驗證\n往後所有自製韌體更新皆可直接透過 SD 卡安全安裝，無須再接 UART",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    }
  ]
